 .../GraphicsPipeline/DiffractionKernel.cpp    |  9 +++--
 .../CinematicCamera/DiffractionKernelSpec.md  | 33 ++++++++++++------
 .../Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h         |  7 ++--
 Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md     | 14 +++++---
