+| Streak Amount | 0-4 (slider 0-2) | 1.0 | Strength of the wave glare. 1 is the physical answer: the source deposits exactly the fraction of its light the pupil diffracts away, typically 5-15 % (about 7 % for an 8-blade iris). Above 1 is the exaggeration side. **Wave only**: in Analytic the f-number ramp still owns the amount. |
